{
  "title": "Dua for delaying death (Ajal)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Twenty-fourth: the Holy Prophet (s) is reported to have said: whoever would like to be granted a long lifetime, victory over the enemies, and protection against a violent death, must repeat this glorification three times at the very beginning of the night and three times at the very beginning of the morning:\nسُبْحَانَ اللهِ مِلْءَ الْمِيْزَانِ وَ مُنْتَهَى الْحِلْمِ وَ مَبْلَغَ الرِّضَا وَ زِنَةَ الْعَرْشِ\nSUBHAANALLAAHI MIL-AL MEEZAAN, WA MUNTAHAL HILM, WA MABLAGHAR RIDAA, WA ZINATAL A'RSH\nGlory be to Allah, the fill of the scale, the utmost of forbearance, the extent of [His] pleasure, and the weight of the Throne."
}
